{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Greek Nymph on a divine journey to heal and reconcile with Hera. Travel ancient Greece in a first person narratively driven journey, as you find Echo's friends and family to find the pieces of her entrusted to them. Discover her past and work towards her future. Be sure to avoid detection of those who would bar your path. Overcome the puzzles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/extras/Locating_Echos_ScreenGrab_Gif.gif?t=1741843101\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caduceus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Locating Echo the Caduceus is your lifeline. It will paint the world with color for you to navigate by where sounds occur. Different colors indicate different sources of sound, so be careful when you see the color of footsteps before you that you might have missed. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3362760?t=1741843101","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/2df251cf2afcea6a0a8cc73c4668fb21d0ed7495/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741843101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/ebdd79b666dcc8b5956a1fb741623ddb5d2f344c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741843101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362760/ebdd79b666dcc8b5956a1fb741623ddb5d2f344c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741843101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Greek Nymph on a divine journey to heal and reconcile with Hera. 